// ABC-SMC: the tolerance epsilon decreases from infinity (the prior) to 0.5,
// each tolerance chosen so that the conditional effective sample size is 0.9
// of the particles. After each reweighting the particles are moved by five
// iterations of ABC-MCMC (random walk on log_theta with covariance p3) at the
// current tolerance.

/***m_proposal,ilike::mvnorm_rw(log_theta,p3)***/

/***mcmc_termination,ilike::iterations(5)***/

/***smc_sequence,ilike::parameter(epsilon,c(Inf,0.5))***/

/***adaptive_target,ilike::cess(0.9)***/
